WEBVTT

00:07:28.569 --> 00:07:31.906
Three things that I can almost guarantee
you have in your home.

00:07:32.531 --> 00:07:33.949
Measuring cups,

00:07:33.991 --> 00:07:36.327
kitchen sponges and you.

00:07:36.911 --> 00:07:42.166
Because a couple household materials
dropped into the bathtub,

00:07:42.208 --> 00:07:44.668
and this mundane routine

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:49.340
becomes fun and surprisingly
energizing bonding time

00:07:49.381 --> 00:07:51.133
for you and your child.

00:07:51.133 --> 00:07:52.343
And bonus,

00:07:52.384 --> 00:07:57.765
instead of the manufacturer-designed toy
telling your child how to play,

00:07:57.806 --> 00:08:00.768
your child's brain
has to do the heavy lifting.